          %p
            where on the right we used the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+property"} universal property
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+pullback"} homotopy pullback
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diagram"} diagram
            which exhibits the smooth
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/circle+group"} circle group
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
